### Dana founds Acme Repairs. `tenancy.selfService.createTenants.creatorRoles` makes its founder a `dispatcher`, and
### the founder owns what she created.
# @name DanaCreatesAcme
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Repairs" }

### She invites a technician. The code is in this answer and in no later one.
# @name DanaInvitesTheo
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants/{{DanaCreatesAcme.response.body.$.tenantId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": ["technician"] }

### Whoever holds the code may see what it is an invitation to — with no credential at all, so a sign-up page can show
### "Dana invited you to Acme Repairs" before the person has an account.
# @name AnyonePreviews
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/invitations/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{DanaInvitesTheo.response.body.$.code}}" }

### Theo accepts it, signed in as himself
# @name TheoAccepts
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/invitations/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{TheoAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{DanaInvitesTheo.response.body.$.code}}" }

### And again — a double click, a retried request. A member accepting is answered with the membership he holds.
# @name TheoAcceptsAgain
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/invitations/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{TheoAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{DanaInvitesTheo.response.body.$.code}}" }

### Acme's members, as its owner sees them
# @name DanaListsMembers
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
GET {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants/{{DanaCreatesAcme.response.body.$.tenantId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}

### Acme's invitations, as its owner sees them — the used one included, its code nowhere
# @name DanaListsInvitations
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
GET {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants/{{DanaCreatesAcme.response.body.$.tenantId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}
